{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/991507-werewolf-packs-for-my-13th-century-chronicle","id":991507,"title":"Werewolf Packs for my 13th century Chronicle","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Werewolf: The Forsaken"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-10-22T13:34:44-07:00","id":991507,"title":"Werewolf Packs for my 13th century Chronicle","content":"So as some of you here know I am a fan of using Forsaken in Classic World Of Darkness so recently I have begun writing my own chronicle as a replacement for part two of vampire the masquerade under a black cross. Instead of players going to Acre they are fighting in the North Crusade alongside the Ventrue Jurgen Sword Barer in Poland, now Jurgen is actually looking for allies among the Pagans because his main objective is to bring down Valadimir Rustovich. Now I am still keeping the war between the Tzimisce and werewolves in my game but the Stormlords are the only Tribe who plays a major part of that war. So here is a question I pose for you if your interested in helping me, can you think of any packs for the Werewolves in Eastern Europe. They do not have to be pagan nor do they have to be against all vampires. I just need ideas for 13th century packs and leaders. I do already have one pack leader created Timas Schultz a Prussian Pagan chieftan who made it his mission in life to push the fiends out of the Carpathians for the sacking of his village and the murder of his slaves and peasants. Low harmony, possible kinslayer, who would ally with the Christians as long as he can take the Fiend's subjects as slaves. But his methods would be considered brutal even by members of his tribe. A cruel, illiterate barbarian sadist.<br /> I also have Blood Talons and other tribes make appearances including Boneless Harald from Tribes Of The Moon because I could easily see that mad bastard joining the North Crusade in hopes of killing Pure Packs on the battlefield.<br /> <img class=\"bbcode-attachment js-need-data-att-update\" src=\"filedata/fetch?filedataid=482\" data-tempid=\"temp_482_1477348593633_510\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":10343,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10343-the-anubi","user":"The Anubi","date":". 10-24-2016, 06:37 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10343-the-anubi","name":"The Anubi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10343_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"116"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}